# CLI & TUI Architecture

## Cobra
- Root command lives in `cmd/root.go`; sub‑commands one file each.
- All commands accept a `*cobra.Command` parent for injection testing.
- Persistent flags are defined in `root.go`; local flags in the sub‑command.

## Bubbletea / Charmbracelet
- Keep each `tea.Model` in its own file; state is immutable structs.
- Never perform blocking I/O in `Update`; delegate to goroutines and return msgs.
